---
import { reviewMode } from '../../data/site';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Water Damage Restoration in West Palm Beach, FL" description="Restoration for homes, businesses and managed buildings in Palm Beach County from WRG’s West Palm Beach office." active="locations">

    <!-- 1 · Local hero: preparation first -->
    <section class="sec ihero bg-canvas" aria-labelledby="t">
      <div class="wrap">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/locations/">Locations</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">West Palm Beach, FL</span></li></ol></nav>
        <div class="ihero-grid" style="align-items: start">
          <div class="ihero-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">West Palm Beach · Palm Beach County</p>
            <h1 class="h1" id="t">Water Damage Restoration <span class="soft">in West Palm Beach, FL</span></h1>
            <p class="lead">Property damage can interrupt a household, disrupt a business or create urgent decisions for a building manager. WRG’s West Palm Beach office supports the restoration conversation for properties in Palm Beach County. Call our 24/7 team to discuss the damage, access to the property and the next steps for assessment.</p>
            <div class="cta-row">
              <a class="btn btn-call btn-lg" href="tel:+18443799283"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.6 3.5h2.6l1.6 4.2-2.1 1.3a11.5 11.5 0 0 0 6.3 6.3l1.3-2.1 4.2 1.6v2.6a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2A16.6 16.6 0 0 1 4.6 5.7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2.2z"></path></svg><span>Call now</span><span class="num">(844) 379-9283</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ready">
            <p class="eyebrow">Before you call</p>
            <h2 class="h3">What to have ready</h2>
            <ol>
              <li>The property address</li>
              <li>The type of damage you have observed</li>
              <li>The best contact for access to the property</li>
              <li>Any access restrictions the team should know about</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2 · Office details near the top -->
    <section class="sec bg-white" style="--st: clamp(40px, 4cqi, 56px); --sb: clamp(40px, 4cqi, 56px)" aria-labelledby="of">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="callout" style="background: #082b38; color: #ffffff">
          <div class="stack g8 on-dark">
            <p class="eyebrow" id="of">West Palm Beach office</p>
            <address class="h3" style="font-weight: 500">1705 Donna Road, Unit #10, West Palm Beach, FL 33409</address>
            <p class="small muted">Phone support for this office runs through the 24/7 line: (844) 379-9283.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-row on-dark">
            <a class="btn btn-call" href="tel:+18443799283">Call WRG</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=1705+Donna+Road+Unit+10+West+Palm+Beach+FL+33409" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get directions</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 · Local context: access and coordination -->
    <section class="sec sheet dark" data-cur="" data-tone="dark" aria-labelledby="ctx">
      <span class="cur" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="cur-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <div class="stack"><p class="eyebrow">Local context</p><h2 class="h2" id="ctx">Plan the next step around your property.</h2></div>
          <p class="lead aside">After a leak or storm-related incident, a useful starting point is knowing who can coordinate access and communicate with the people affected.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="trio">
          <div class="trio-item rv"><b>If you manage a building</b><p class="small" style="color: #dcebef">Identify who coordinates access to units and common areas, and who communicates decisions to residents or tenants.</p></div>
          <div class="trio-item rv d2"><b>If you own a home</b><p class="small" style="color: #dcebef">Have the property address and a primary contact ready. That makes the first conversation clearer.</p></div>
          <div class="trio-item rv d3"><b>After a storm</b><p class="small" style="color: #dcebef">Access plans remain subject to actual conditions and applicable restrictions. Share what you know when you call.</p><p class="tell"><a class="lnk" href="/faqs/">Read common questions before you call</a></p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4 · Services -->
    <section class="sec bg-canvas" aria-labelledby="sv">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <div class="stack"><p class="eyebrow">Services</p><h2 class="h2" id="sv">Restoration services in Palm Beach County</h2></div>
          <div class="aside stack g12"><p class="muted">Call to confirm service for your property’s address.</p>{reviewMode && <span class="review-flag">Availability by office and detailed coverage pending confirmation</span>}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-chips">
          <a class="svc-chip" href="/services/water-damage-restoration/"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3.5s6.5 6.6 6.5 11.1a6.5 6.5 0 0 1-13 0C5.5 10.1 12 3.5 12 3.5z"></path></svg>Water damage restoration in West Palm Beach</a>
          <a class="svc-chip" href="/services/fire-damage-restoration/"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3c.6 3.2 4.8 5.3 4.8 10a4.8 4.8 0 0 1-9.6 0c0-2.3 1.2-3.8 2.4-4.8.2 1.7 1 2.8 2.1 3.2C11 9 11.3 5.6 12 3z"></path></svg>Fire &amp; smoke restoration</a>
          <a class="svc-chip" href="/services/mold-remediation/"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8.5" cy="9" r="3.2"></circle><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r="2"></circle><circle cx="14.5" cy="16" r="3.8"></circle></svg>Mold remediation</a>
          <a class="svc-chip" href="/services/reconstruction/"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 11 12 4l8.5 7"></path><path d="M5.5 9.5V20h13V9.5"></path></svg>Reconstruction</a>
          <a class="svc-chip" href="/services/">All services</a>
        </div>
        {reviewMode && (<p class="notice" style="margin-top: 40px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 8v5M12 16.5v.01"></path></svg><span><b>Internal review:</b> No West Palm Beach project, review or team profile has been confirmed. The evidence module stays hidden, and Miami-area cases are not reused here as if they had happened in Palm Beach County.</span></p>)}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5 · FAQ -->
    <section class="sec bg-white" aria-labelledby="fq">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="faq-grid">
          <div class="split-head"><p class="eyebrow">West Palm Beach FAQ</p><h2 class="h2" id="fq">Questions before the first call</h2></div>
          <div class="faq">
            <details open=""><summary>What information should I have ready when I call?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="ans">Share the property address, the type of damage you have observed and the best contact for access. Let the team know about any access restrictions.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Which number should I call for the West Palm Beach office?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="ans">Call WRG’s 24/7 phone team at (844) 379-9283, also listed as 1 (844) DRY-WATER.</p></details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec sheet dark cta-band" data-tone="dark" aria-labelledby="cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="cta-grid">
          <div class="stack g16"><p class="eyebrow">Talk to WRG</p><h2 class="h2" id="cta">Tell us about the property and who can coordinate access.</h2></div>
          <div class="callcard"><span class="small muted">24/7 Emergency Phone Support</span><a class="num-l" href="tel:+18443799283">(844) 379-9283</a><a class="btn btn-call" href="tel:+18443799283">Call now</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
